     names: 54 of 55 right (0 wrong, 1 missing; Hrothgar 2/3)   nickname "Bell" 2/2 kept
     rules words: 12 of 12   false names: 0   everyday lines: WER 3% (2 of 68)
     pieces: 20 (longest 15.0 s)   7.3 s for 175 s of speech
